aiSettings.setVehicleBehaviour Tank		TakeCover	BBTakeCover		BBPTakeCover			6 0 UCUnion UnitWeights
aiSettings.setVehicleBehaviour Tank		Change		BBChange		BBPChange			6 0 UCUnion ChangeInhibit
aiSettings.setVehicleDefaultBehaviour Tank             Idle
